1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,080
Vocês escolheram

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,590
o portal congelado.

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,140
E,

4
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:03,540
assim que

5
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,280
eles chegaram,

6
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:04,760
um martelo

7
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,540
caiu do céu bem

8
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,830
na frente de Zeus!

9
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,670
Depois de encontrarem

10
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:09,210
os guardiões

11
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:09,990
da floresta,

12
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:10,170
Zeus,

13
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:11,470
Xangô e Tupã atravessaram

14
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,210
o portal levando

15
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,700
o fragmento misterioso.

16
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:14,760
Mas o frio daquele

17
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:15,700
lugar era tão forte

18
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,460
que a barba de Zeus

19
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,890
congelou em segundos.

20
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,180
Montanhas de gelo,

21
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:20,760
luzes dançando

22
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,660
no céu e um silêncio

23
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,520
que parecia esconder

24
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,590
alguma coisa.

25
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,660
Então,

26
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,920
o martelo levantou do chão

27
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:26,900
e voltou voando para

28
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,150
a mão do seu dono.

29
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,340
Era Thor,

30
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,160
o deus do trovão das

31
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,550
histórias nórdicas.

32
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,760
E ele não parecia nada

33
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,150
feliz com a visita.

34
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:35,370
Zeus cruzou

35
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:36,515
os braços e disse:

36
00:00:36,515 --> 00:00:37,295
Quatro senhores

37
00:00:37,295 --> 00:00:38,645
dos trovões?

38
00:00:39,015 --> 00:00:39,535
Isso já está

39
00:00:39,535 --> 00:00:41,045
virando campeonato!

40
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:43,820
Thor ergueu o martelo.

41
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:44,490
Mas,

42
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:44,870
antes do

43
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:45,770
primeiro golpe,

44
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:46,330
Tupã mostrou

45
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:47,480
o fragmento.

46
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:48,700
Thor reconheceu

47
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,050
o símbolo na hora.

48
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:50,980
Ele estava gravado

49
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:51,580
na ponte que

50
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:52,730
liga os mundos.

51
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:54,050
O grupo correu até

52
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,270
a ponte de arco-íris,

53
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:55,810
onde um guardião

54
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,580
vigiava todos os reinos.

55
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:58,840
Era Heimdall,

56
00:00:58,840 --> 00:00:59,720
o guardião que,

57
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:00,760
nessas histórias,

58
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:01,200
consegue ver

59
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,610
e ouvir quase tudo.

60
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:03,520
Ele olhou para

61
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,901
o grupo e disse:

62
00:01:04,901 --> 00:01:06,081
Vocês não

63
00:01:06,081 --> 00:01:07,671
vieram sozinhos.

64
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,260
A sombra que tinha

65
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:10,080
atravessado com eles

66
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,060
saiu do meio da neve

67
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,450
e fugiu pela ponte.

68
00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:13,840
Ela correu até uma

69
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,060
árvore gigantesca,

70
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:15,960
cujas raízes,

71
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,860
nesta aventura,

72
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:18,410
ligam todos os mundos.

73
00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:19,450
E as raízes

74
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:20,860
estavam escurecendo.

75
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:22,090
Cada portal aberto era

76
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:23,480
uma ferida na árvore.

77
00:01:24,190 --> 00:01:25,170
Thor, Zeus,

78
00:01:25,170 --> 00:01:25,710
Xangô e Tupã

79
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:26,450
lançaram quatro

80
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:27,430
raios ao mesmo tempo

81
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:28,680
contra a escuridão.

82
00:01:29,690 --> 00:01:30,810
A sombra recuou...

83
00:01:30,810 --> 00:01:31,630
mas deixou para trás

84
00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:32,830
um segundo fragmento,

85
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:34,140
com a mesma marca.

86
00:01:34,690 --> 00:01:35,270
Quando os dois

87
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:36,550
fragmentos se tocaram,

88
00:01:36,550 --> 00:01:36,990
eles formaram

89
00:01:36,990 --> 00:01:38,220
parte de um mapa.

90
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:39,580
E o mapa apontava

91
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:40,260
para alguém que estava

92
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,340
observando tudo desde

93
00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:42,470
o primeiro portal.

94
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:43,860
Cada mil

95
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:44,840
curtidas revela mais

96
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,350
um pedaço desse mapa.

97
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,180
Opção A:

98
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:49,960
descer até

99
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:50,860
as raízes da árvore

100
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,130
e seguir a criatura.

101
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,000
Opção B:

102
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,960
levar os fragmentos

103
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:56,740
até Anúbis,

104
00:01:56,740 --> 00:01:57,480
no Egito,

105
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,220
e descobrir quem

106
00:01:58,220 --> 00:01:59,490
é o observador.

107
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,299
Comente A ou B.

108
00:02:01,299 --> 00:02:02,351
Mas cuidado...

109
00:02:02,351 --> 00:02:03,571
o observador também

110
00:02:03,571 --> 00:02:05,341
está assistindo vocês.
